WEBVTT

00:00.920 --> 00:07.500
Traitorous creature! Gaze upon the ancestral tablets of our forefathers and reflect upon your crimes! Do you still remember your family name?!

00:11.960 --> 00:13.000
Chen.

00:13.360 --> 00:20.000
Ah, so you still remember! Do not think those decrepit elders can shield you forever!

00:20.000 --> 00:26.000
Make her kneel here for two full days to clear her head—let no one grant her a single sip of water!

00:26.500 --> 00:37.000
Ruling over centuries of imperial foundation, the Great Xuan dynasty seems long accustomed to resting content in its southern sanctuary.

00:37.000 --> 00:48.000
So long as the natural rampart of the Great River holds, the world indulges peacefully in the warm embrace of the south.
